title: Remove sp-std from election-provider-multi-block and election-provider-support
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Removes the `sp-std` dependency from `pallet-election-provider-multi-block` and
    `frame-election-provider-support` in favour of `core` and `alloc`. The public API of these
    crates is unchanged.
crates:
- name: pallet-election-provider-multi-block
  bump: patch
- name: frame-election-provider-support
  bump: patch
